<title>USA: SSE Telecom Inc names Kinsch CFO.</title>
<headline>SSE Telecom Inc names Kinsch CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>SSE Telecom Inc, a maker of satellite earth-station components, said Wednesday it has named Russ Kinsch as its new chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Kinsch replaces Charlie Pai, who recently left the company to take another job, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Kinsch joins SSE from electronics component company Signal Technology Corp where he was chief financial officer, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
